title: The Desk
kicker: Department of Culture · Internal
lead: Everything the Department runs on, in one place. The Collection holds the files; the standing orders say how they are kept.
---

<div class="callout callout--red">
  <span class="label label--red">Standing reminder</span>
  The Department watches, gathers, records and refers. It never arrests, searches or seizes on its own authority, and a Curator never answers a question of meaning. Anything that turns on what the Doctrine means is written down and sent to the Director untouched.
</div>

